{"seq":4,"slug":"adapter-methods","title":"Adapter 适配器方法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/llm-fine-tuning/parameter-efficient-methods/adapter-methods","wordCount":1082,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"adapter-适配器方法\">Adapter 适配器方法</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Adapter Tuning 是最早提出的参数高效微调方法之一，其核心思想是在 Transformer 的每一层中插入小型的瓶颈网络（bottleneck module）。这些适配器模块由下投影、非线性激活和上投影组成，通过残差连接与原始层融合。训练时冻结所有预训练参数，只更新适配器参数，可训练参数量占模型总参数的 1-5%。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    A[输入 x] --&gt; B[Multi-Head Attention]&#10;    B --&gt; C[LayerNorm + 残差]&#10;    C --&gt; D[Adapter 1]&#10;    D --&gt; E[Feed-Forward Network]&#10;    E --&gt; F[LayerNorm + 残差]&#10;    F --&gt; G[Adapter 2]&#10;    G --&gt; H[输出]&#10;    subgraph Adapter 结构&#10;        D1[下投影 d→r] --&gt; D2[非线性 ReLU]&#10;        D2 --&gt; D3[上投影 r→d]&#10;    end\">graph TB\n    A[输入 x] --&gt; B[Multi-Head Attention]\n    B --&gt; C[LayerNorm + 残差]\n    C --&gt; D[Adapter 1]\n    D --&gt; E[Feed-Forward Network]\n    E --&gt; F[LayerNorm + 残差]\n    F --&gt; G[Adapter 2]\n    G --&gt; H[输出]\n    subgraph Adapter 结构\n        D1[下投影 d→r] --&gt; D2[非线性 ReLU]\n        D2 --&gt; D3[上投影 r→d]\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>适配器变体</th>\n<th>插入位置</th>\n<th>参数量</th>\n<th>推理开销</th>\n<th>效果</th>\n<th>特点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Serial Adapter</td>\n<td>Attn + FFN 后</td>\n<td>1-5%</td>\n<td>增加延迟</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>经典设计</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Parallel Adapter</td>\n<td>与 Attn/FFN 并行</td>\n<td>1-3%</td>\n<td>增加延迟</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>更好的梯度流</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>AdapterFusion</td>\n<td>多适配器融合</td>\n<td>2-5%</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n<td>最高</td>\n<td>多任务组合</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Compacter</td>\n<td>低秩参数化</td>\n<td>0.05%</td>\n<td>极小</td>\n<td>中高</td>\n<td>超紧凑</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LLM-Adapters</td>\n<td>灵活位置</td>\n<td>可调</td>\n<td>可调</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>LLM 专用</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"瓶颈网络设计\">瓶颈网络设计</h2><p>Adapter 的核心是瓶颈结构——先将维度从 d 降到 r（通常 r=64-256），经过非线性激活后再升回 d 维。残差连接确保了当适配器输出接近零时，模型行为退化为原始预训练模型。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import torch&#10;import torch.nn as nn&#10;&#10;class BottleneckAdapter(nn.Module):&#10;    def __init__(self, d_model: int, bottleneck_dim: int, dropout: float = 0.1):&#10;        super().__init__()&#10;        self.down_proj = nn.Linear(d_model, bottleneck_dim)&#10;        self.activation = nn.ReLU()&#10;        self.up_proj = nn.Linear(bottleneck_dim, d_model)&#10;        self.dropout = nn.Dropout(dropout)&#10;        nn.init.zeros_(self.up_proj.weight)&#10;        nn.init.zeros_(self.up_proj.bias)&#10;&#10;    def forward(self, x: torch.Tensor) -&gt; torch.Tensor:&#10;        residual = x&#10;        x = self.down_proj(x)&#10;        x = self.activation(x)&#10;        x = self.up_proj(x)&#10;        x = self.dropout(x)&#10;        return x + residual\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.nn </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> BottleneckAdapter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">nn</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Module</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, d_model: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, bottleneck_dim: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, dropout: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">float</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        super</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">__init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.down_proj </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn.Linear(d_model, bottleneck_dim)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.activation </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn.ReLU()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.up_proj </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn.Linear(bottleneck_dim, d_model)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.dropout </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn.Dropout(dropout)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        nn.init.zeros_(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.up_proj.weight)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        nn.init.zeros_(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.up_proj.bias)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> forward</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, x: torch.Tensor) -> torch.Tensor:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        residual </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> x</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        x </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.down_proj(x)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        x </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.activation(x)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        x </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.up_proj(x)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        x </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.dropout(x)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> x </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> residual</span></span></code></pre></div><p>上投影层的权重初始化为零是关键设计——它确保训练开始时适配器是一个恒等映射，不会破坏预训练模型的表示。随着训练进行，适配器逐渐学习任务特定的变换。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>超参数</th>\n<th>推荐范围</th>\n<th>影响</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>bottleneck_dim</td>\n<td>64-256</td>\n<td>表达能力 vs 参数量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>dropout</td>\n<td>0-0.1</td>\n<td>正则化强度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>activation</td>\n<td>ReLU/GELU</td>\n<td>非线性选择</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>init_scale</td>\n<td>0 (零初始化)</td>\n<td>训练起始行为</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>插入频率</td>\n<td>每层 / 隔层</td>\n<td>参数量 vs 效果</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"parallel-adapter-与-adapterfusion\">Parallel Adapter 与 AdapterFusion</h2><p>传统的 Serial Adapter 串联在 Transformer 层之后，会增加模型的深度和推理延迟。Parallel Adapter 将适配器与原始层并行放置，通过加权求和融合输出，提供了更好的梯度流动：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"class ParallelAdapter(nn.Module):&#10;    def __init__(self, d_model: int, bottleneck_dim: int, scaling: float = 1.0):&#10;        super().__init__()&#10;        self.down_proj = nn.Linear(d_model, bottleneck_dim)&#10;        self.activation = nn.GELU()&#10;        self.up_proj = nn.Linear(bottleneck_dim, d_model)&#10;        self.scaling = scaling&#10;&#10;    def forward(self, x: torch.Tensor, original_output: torch.Tensor) -&gt; torch.Tensor:&#10;        adapter_out = self.up_proj(self.activation(self.down_proj(x)))&#10;        return original_output + self.scaling * adapter_out\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ParallelAdapter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">nn</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Module</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, d_model: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, bottleneck_dim: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, scaling: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">float</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        super</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">__init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.down_proj </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn.Linear(d_model, bottleneck_dim)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.activation </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn.GELU()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.up_proj </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn.Linear(bottleneck_dim, d_model)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.scaling </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> scaling</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> forward</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, x: torch.Tensor, original_output: torch.Tensor) -> torch.Tensor:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        adapter_out </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.up_proj(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.activation(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.down_proj(x)))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> original_output </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.scaling </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> adapter_out</span></span></code></pre></div><p>AdapterFusion 进一步扩展了适配器的能力，允许组合多个预训练适配器来处理新任务。它在多个适配器之上添加一个注意力层，学习不同适配器的动态组合权重：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"class AdapterFusion(nn.Module):&#10;    def __init__(self, d_model: int, num_adapters: int):&#10;        super().__init__()&#10;        self.query = nn.Linear(d_model, d_model)&#10;        self.key = nn.Linear(d_model, d_model)&#10;        self.value = nn.Linear(d_model, d_model)&#10;        self.num_adapters = num_adapters&#10;&#10;    def forward(self, hidden: torch.Tensor, adapter_outputs: list[torch.Tensor]) -&gt; torch.Tensor:&#10;        q = self.query(hidden)&#10;        stacked = torch.stack(adapter_outputs, dim=-2)&#10;        k = self.key(stacked)&#10;        v = self.value(stacked)&#10;        attn = torch.softmax(torch.matmul(q.unsqueeze(-2), k.transpose(-1, -2)) / (q.size(-1) ** 0.5), dim=-1)&#10;        return torch.matmul(attn, v).squeeze(-2)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> AdapterFusion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">nn</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Module</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, d_model: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, num_adapters: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        super</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">__init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.query </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn.Linear(d_model, d_model)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.key </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn.Linear(d_model, d_model)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.value </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn.Linear(d_model, d_model)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.num_adapters </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> num_adapters</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> forward</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, hidden: torch.Tensor, adapter_outputs: list[torch.Tensor]) -> torch.Tensor:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        q </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.query(hidden)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        stacked </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.stack(adapter_outputs, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">dim</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        k </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.key(stacked)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        v </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.value(stacked)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        attn </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.softmax(torch.matmul(q.unsqueeze(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), k.transpose(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (q.size(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">**</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">dim</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.matmul(attn, v).squeeze(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>Serial Adapter</th>\n<th>Parallel Adapter</th>\n<th>AdapterFusion</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>训练方式</td>\n<td>独立训练</td>\n<td>独立训练</td>\n<td>组合预训练适配器</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>梯度流</td>\n<td>受深度影响</td>\n<td>更直接</td>\n<td>通过注意力</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多任务支持</td>\n<td>每任务独立</td>\n<td>每任务独立</td>\n<td>动态组合</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>额外参数</td>\n<td>瓶颈网络</td>\n<td>瓶颈网络 + 缩放</td>\n<td>瓶颈网络 + 融合层</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"使用-peft-库实践\">使用 PEFT 库实践</h2><p>HuggingFace 的 PEFT 库通过 AdaLoRA 配置支持类似适配器的功能，同时 adapters 库提供了更完整的适配器生态：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from transformers import AutoModelForCausalLM, AutoTokenizer, TrainingArguments&#10;from peft import get_peft_model, AdaLoraConfig, TaskType&#10;&#10;model = AutoModelForCausalLM.from_pretrained(&#10;    &quot;Qwen/Qwen3-8B&quot;,&#10;    torch_dtype=&quot;auto&quot;,&#10;    device_map=&quot;auto&quot;,&#10;)&#10;&#10;adalora_config = AdaLoraConfig(&#10;    task_type=TaskType.CAUSAL_LM,&#10;    r=16,&#10;    lora_alpha=32,&#10;    target_modules=[&quot;q_proj&quot;, &quot;v_proj&quot;, &quot;k_proj&quot;, &quot;o_proj&quot;],&#10;    init_r=12,&#10;    target_r=8,&#10;    beta1=0.85,&#10;    beta2=0.85,&#10;    tinit=200,&#10;    tfinal=1000,&#10;    deltaT=10,&#10;)&#10;&#10;model = get_peft_model(model, adalora_config)&#10;model.print_trainable_parameters()\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> transformers </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> AutoModelForCausalLM, AutoTokenizer, TrainingArguments</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> peft </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> get_peft_model, AdaLoraConfig, TaskType</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">model </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> AutoModelForCausalLM.from_pretrained(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"Qwen/Qwen3-8B\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    torch_dtype</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"auto\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    device_map</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"auto\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">adalora_config </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> AdaLoraConfig(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    task_type</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">TaskType.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">CAUSAL_LM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    r</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">16</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    lora_alpha</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">32</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    target_modules</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"q_proj\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"v_proj\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"k_proj\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"o_proj\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    init_r</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">12</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    target_r</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">8</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    beta1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.85</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    beta2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.85</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    tinit</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">200</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    tfinal</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    deltaT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">model </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> get_peft_model(model, adalora_config)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">model.print_trainable_parameters()</span></span></code></pre></div><p>AdaLoRA 的创新在于自适应秩分配——它在训练过程中动态调整不同层的秩大小，对重要的层分配更高的秩，对不太重要的层降低秩。这种策略在参数预算固定的情况下能获得更好的效果。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface AdapterComparison {&#10;  method: string;&#10;  parameterBudget: string;&#10;  bestUseCase: string;&#10;  limitation: string;&#10;}&#10;&#10;const adapterMethods: AdapterComparison[] = [&#10;  {&#10;    method: &#39;Serial Adapter&#39;,&#10;    parameterBudget: &#39;1-5%&#39;,&#10;    bestUseCase: &#39;通用任务适配&#39;,&#10;    limitation: &#39;增加推理延迟&#39;,&#10;  },&#10;  {&#10;    method: &#39;Parallel Adapter&#39;,&#10;    parameterBudget: &#39;1-3%&#39;,&#10;    bestUseCase: &#39;对延迟不敏感的场景&#39;,&#10;    limitation: &#39;实现复杂度稍高&#39;,&#10;  },&#10;  {&#10;    method: &#39;AdaLoRA&#39;,&#10;    parameterBudget: &#39;0.1-1%&#39;,&#10;    bestUseCase: &#39;参数预算严格时&#39;,&#10;    limitation: &#39;训练时间更长&#39;,&#10;  },&#10;  {&#10;    method: &#39;AdapterFusion&#39;,&#10;    parameterBudget: &#39;2-5%&#39;,&#10;    bestUseCase: &#39;多任务知识迁移&#39;,&#10;    limitation: &#39;需要预训练多个适配器&#39;,&#10;  },&#10;];\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> AdapterComparison</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  method</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  parameterBudget</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  bestUseCase</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  limitation</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> adapterMethods</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> AdapterComparison</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    method: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Serial Adapter'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    parameterBudget: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'1-5%'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    bestUseCase: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'通用任务适配'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    limitation: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'增加推理延迟'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    method: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Parallel Adapter'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    parameterBudget: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'1-3%'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    bestUseCase: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'对延迟不敏感的场景'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    limitation: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'实现复杂度稍高'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    method: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'AdaLoRA'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    parameterBudget: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'0.1-1%'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    bestUseCase: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'参数预算严格时'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    limitation: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'训练时间更长'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    method: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'AdapterFusion'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    parameterBudget: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'2-5%'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    bestUseCase: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'多任务知识迁移'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    limitation: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'需要预训练多个适配器'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"adapter-与-lora-对比选型\">Adapter 与 LoRA 对比选型</h2><p>在实际项目中，Adapter 和 LoRA 是最常用的两类 PEFT 方法。选择哪种方法取决于具体的约束条件：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>Adapter Tuning</th>\n<th>LoRA</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>参数量</td>\n<td>较多（1-5%）</td>\n<td>较少（0.1-1%）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>推理开销</td>\n<td>有额外延迟</td>\n<td>可合并消除</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>表达能力</td>\n<td>更强（有非线性）</td>\n<td>受限于线性变换</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多任务切换</td>\n<td>插拔适配器</td>\n<td>切换权重矩阵</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>生态支持</td>\n<td>adapter-hub</td>\n<td>PEFT/LoRA</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>生产部署</td>\n<td>需保留适配器</td>\n<td>合并后等同原模型</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>对于大多数 LLM 微调场景，LoRA 因其推理零开销的特性成为默认选择。Adapter 方法在以下场景更有优势：需要更强的非线性表达能力、多任务组合（AdapterFusion）、或者需要在推理时动态选择不同适配策略。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>Adapter Tuning 通过瓶颈网络实现参数高效微调，可训练参数占 1-5%</li>\n<li>零初始化上投影层确保训练起始时不破坏预训练表示</li>\n<li>Parallel Adapter 改善了梯度流，AdapterFusion 支持多适配器动态组合</li>\n<li>AdaLoRA 通过自适应秩分配在固定参数预算下优化效果</li>\n<li>与 LoRA 相比，Adapter 表达能力更强但有推理延迟开销</li>\n<li>生产环境中 LoRA 更受欢迎，Adapter 适合需要非线性变换或多任务融合的场景</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Adapter 适配器方法","id":"adapter-适配器方法"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"瓶颈网络设计","id":"瓶颈网络设计"},{"level":2,"text":"Parallel Adapter 与 AdapterFusion","id":"parallel-adapter-与-adapterfusion"},{"level":2,"text":"使用 PEFT 库实践","id":"使用-peft-库实践"},{"level":2,"text":"Adapter 与 LoRA 对比选型","id":"adapter-与-lora-对比选型"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"其他参数高效方法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/llm-fine-tuning/parameter-efficient-methods/other-peft-methods"},"next":{"title":"Prefix Tuning 前缀微调","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/llm-fine-tuning/parameter-efficient-methods/prefix-tuning"}}